msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dishy holds his gloved hands out in front of him, turning them over as his gaze slowly drifts from his hands down to his body. He evaluates himself with a cold efficiency."
msgstr "Dishy tend devant lui ses mains gantées et les retourne, son regard glissant lentement de ses mains vers son corps. Il s'évalue avec une froide efficacité."

