msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Daisuke tries to cram Dishy's bowels with baking sheets, but he slams his door on him!"
msgstr "Daisuke tente de bourrer les entrailles de Dishy de plaques de cuisson, mais celui-ci lui claque sa porte dessus !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/daisuke_join/0/daisukeattackjoin/c-2/26/b/12
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "No!!! He nearly cracked me!"
msgstr "Non !!! Il a bien failli me fissurer !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/daisuke_join/0/daisukeattackjoin/c-3/15
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Here!"
msgstr "Tenez !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: dishy_dishwasher/daisuke_join/0/daisukeattackjoin/c-3/40
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Armed with the ladle, your attack power is increased by"
msgstr "Avec la louche en main, ta puissance d'attaque augmente de"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/daisuke_join/0/daisukeattackjoin/c-3/50
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Use it well!"
msgstr "Servez-vous-en bien !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/daisuke_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I cannot leave the dishes unguarded any longer. Godspeed."
msgstr "Je ne puis laisser la vaisselle sans garde plus longtemps. Que la fortune vous accompagne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/longerladle/8
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I can extend the one you have!"
msgstr "Je puis rallonger celle que vous avez !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: dishy_dishwasher/longerladle/29
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Amazingly, the length of your ladle is extended... increasing your attack power by"
msgstr "Incroyable : la longueur de ta louche s'étend... et ta puissance d'attaque augmente de"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/longerladle/49
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Use it well."
msgstr "Servez-vous-en bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/0
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "...you seek the forbidden ladle of immaculate strength."
msgstr "...vous cherchez la louche interdite à la force immaculée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/8
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Such a ladle has never been forged, but..."
msgstr "Pareille louche n'a jamais été forgée, mais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/19
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I will do my utmost."
msgstr "Je ferai tout mon possible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/30
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Daisuke works true magic - and forges a ladle of impossible potency."
msgstr "Daisuke opère une véritable magie et forge une louche d'une puissance impossible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/41
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "The Final Ladle."
msgstr "La Louche Ultime."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/49
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "I can do no more for you."
msgstr "Je ne puis rien faire de plus pour vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/final_ladle/60
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Your attack power is increased to 90 damage!"
msgstr "Ta puissance d'attaque passe à 90 dégâts !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/8
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "WWOOOOOHOOOO BOSS BATTLE!"
msgstr "WOOOOHOOO, COMBAT DE BOSS !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/19
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I've waited all my life for this."
msgstr "J'ai attendu ça toute ma vie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank goodness you're here! Help!"
msgstr "Dieu merci, tu es là ! À l'aide !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I'm better off without you, Sinclaire..."
msgstr "Je crois que je m'en sortirais mieux sans toi, Sinclaire..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "You got it! I have lots of options."
msgstr "Comme tu voudras ! J'ai plein d'options."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "You're right! And yet I remain!"
msgstr "Tu as raison ! Et pourtant je reste !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sic Sudsy on him!"
msgstr "Lance Sudsy sur lui !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Overflow his water supply!"
msgstr "Fais déborder son arrivée d'eau !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talk some sense into him!"
msgstr "Fais-lui entendre raison !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just... I don't know... Hit him with something!"
msgstr "Juste... je sais pas... frappe-le avec quelque chose !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "GET HIM SUDSY!"
msgstr "ATTAQUE, SUDSY !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Sudsy"
msgid "WOOF WOOF!! RRRRrrrr..."
msgstr "OUAF OUAF !! RRRRrrrr..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Sudsy attacks with indomitable force."
msgstr "Sudsy attaque avec une force indomptable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/40
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Bubbles fly in all directions."
msgstr "Des bulles volent dans toutes les directions."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/48
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "You had no idea that sweet little guy had so much potential for raw aggression."
msgstr "Tu ne soupçonnais pas que ce gentil petit gars avait un tel potentiel d'agressivité brute."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-2/59
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Dishy takes 30 damage!"
msgstr "Dishy subit 30 points de dégâts !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Give you the square root of eleven? Of course!"
msgstr "La racine carrée de onze ? Bien sûr !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "It's eight cheese!"
msgstr "Ça fait huit fromages !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-3/26
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Glad to be of service!"
msgstr "Ravi d'avoir rendu service !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-3/34
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Somehow... this heals you for 20 health!"
msgstr "Étrangement... cela te soigne de 20 points de vie !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Great idea! I'm the most sensible one in this house, after all!"
msgstr "Bonne idée ! Je suis le plus sensé de cette maison, après tout !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Dishy, listen up!"
msgstr "Dishy, écoute-moi bien !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "Comme tu voudras."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Watch out Dishy!"
msgstr "Attention, Dishy !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "I'mma hit you with this hot statistic!"
msgstr "Je vais te balancer cette statistique brûlante !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/31
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Total US production of fresh cucumbers dropped from 1087 million pounds in 2000 to 314 million pounds in 2020!"
msgstr "La production américaine totale de concombres frais est passée de 1087 millions de livres en 2000 à 314 millions de livres en 2020 !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/39
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "This information damages Dishy's sense of normalcy, but leaves his combat capabilities intact."
msgstr "Cette information entame le sens de la normalité de Dishy, mais laisse intactes ses capacités de combat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sinclaire_join/0/g-0/c-5/47
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "Glad I could help."
msgstr "Content d'avoir pu aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/0 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/0
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Sinclaire leans in close and whispers into Dishy's ear."
msgstr "Sinclaire se penche tout près et chuchote à l'oreille de Dishy."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/11 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/11
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "At first, Dishy is annoyed."
msgstr "Au début, Dishy est agacé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/16 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/18
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "But slowly, Dishy's expression begins to change..."
msgstr "Mais peu à peu, l'expression de Dishy commence à changer..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/21 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/23
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "He appears to become frustrated, then enraged."
msgstr "Il semble devenir frustré, puis furieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/29 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/31
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Then he begins to laugh..."
msgstr "Puis il se met à rire..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/34 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/36
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Then to cry."
msgstr "Puis à pleurer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/45 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/47
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "His sobs grow deeper and more intense, and his eyes fill with wonder..."
msgstr "Ses sanglots se font plus profonds et plus intenses, et ses yeux se remplissent d'émerveillement..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/50 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/52
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "It is as though he has been shown the meaning of the universe, the answer to the Great Mystery."
msgstr "C'est comme si on lui avait révélé le sens de l'univers, la réponse au Grand Mystère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/58 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/60
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "The face of God."
msgstr "Le visage de Dieu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/66 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/68
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "A hallowed silence fills the room."
msgstr "Un silence sacré envahit la pièce."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/71 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/73
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Dishy looks at you with newfound understanding. He lays down his arms, and bows in humble surrender."
msgstr "Dishy te regarde avec une compréhension nouvelle. Il dépose les armes et s'incline en humble reddition."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/79 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/81
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Slowly, Sinclaire turns, nods to you, and begins to walk slowly into the sunset."
msgstr "Lentement, Sinclaire se retourne, te fait un signe de tête et s'éloigne tranquillement vers le soleil couchant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_1/87 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_sinclaire_end_2/89
msgctxt "Sinclaire"
msgid "My job is done here."
msgstr "Ma mission ici est terminée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jam his rotator with a spatula."
msgstr "Coincer son rotor avec une spatule."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Call Valdivian and change your credit card number."
msgstr "Appeler Valdivian et changer de numéro de carte bancaire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Disconnect wifi."
msgstr "Couper le wifi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Put gum in the detergent dispenser."
msgstr "Mettre du chewing-gum dans le distributeur de détergent."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go back..."
msgstr "Revenir en arrière..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "A fine choice! The spatula will be immovable in there!"
msgstr "Un excellent choix ! La spatule sera impossible à déloger de là-dedans !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-0/12/b/1 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-0/13/b/1
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "Hah! It's barely a tickle."
msgstr "Ha ! C'est à peine un chatouillis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Get ahead of any future upgrades? Smart thinking!"
msgstr "Prendre de l'avance sur les futures mises à niveau ? Bien pensé !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/12
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "Hello, this is Val 9000. How may I help you today?"
msgstr "Bonjour, ici Val 9000. Comment puis-je vous aider aujourd'hui ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Val! Please change my credit card number - it's an emergency!"
msgstr "Val ! Changez mon numéro de carte bancaire, s'il vous plaît, c'est une urgence !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "No! Goodbye."
msgstr "Non ! Au revoir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/10
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "An emergency credit card number change? Troubling."
msgstr "Un changement de numéro de carte bancaire en urgence ? Inquiétant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/15
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "But perhaps this has happened because your identity has been stolen."
msgstr "Mais peut-être est-ce dû au fait que votre identité a été volée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/20
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "I will generate a new identity for you."
msgstr "Je vais générer une nouvelle identité pour vous."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/c-0/7
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "Please be still, it will only hurt a little."
msgstr "Veuillez rester immobile, cela ne fera qu'un peu mal."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/c-0/12
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "Here is your new identity:"
msgstr "Voici votre nouvelle identité :"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/g-0/0
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "All existing credit cards have now been changed as well. We hope you enjoy finding them out on your own time."
msgstr "Toutes les cartes bancaires existantes ont également été modifiées. Nous espérons que vous aurez plaisir à les découvrir par vous-même."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/g-0/5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank... you?"
msgstr "Merci... ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/g-0/5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awesome! I'm unconcerned!"
msgstr "Génial ! Ça m'est égal !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/g-0/5/c-0/7
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "Happy to assist during this difficult time."
msgstr "Ravi de vous assister en cette période difficile."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-1/17/c-0/25/g-0/5/c-1/7
msgctxt "Val 9000"
msgid "See you round the office, champ."
msgstr "À la prochaine au bureau, {{champion|championne|champion·ne}}."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/11
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Without his precious wifi - he'll have to shut down!"
msgstr "Sans son précieux wifi, il devra s'éteindre !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/1 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/1
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "Hmph. I don't have to do anything."
msgstr "Pff. Je ne dois rien du tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/9 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/9
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "... as I have already connected to your neighbor's wifi!"
msgstr "... puisque je me suis déjà connecté au wifi de votre voisin !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/20 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/20
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "Network Name \"CallJalynForPassword\""
msgstr "Nom du réseau « AppelezJalynPourLeMotDePasse »"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/28 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/28
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "Password \"Jalyn\""
msgstr "Mot de passe « Jalyn »"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/36 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/36
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "I... ill... ... ... ... chi..."
msgstr "Je... mal... ... ... ... chi..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/16/b/47 dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-2/17/b/47
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Ah! Because of the distance... it's a little spotty. I think it can help!"
msgstr "Ah ! À cause de la distance... il est un peu capricieux. Je crois que ça peut aider !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/sabotage_menu/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "The gum clogs up the detergent dispenser... leaving Dishy unable to clean himself further!"
msgstr "Le chewing-gum bouche le distributeur de détergent... Dishy ne peut plus se nettoyer !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/10 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/3
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Incredible - you did it!"
msgstr "Incroyable, tu as réussi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/21 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/14
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Okay... I'm going to go now."
msgstr "Bon... je vais y aller."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/29 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/22
msgctxt "Chance"
msgid "Looks like you two have things to work out..."
msgstr "On dirait que vous avez des choses à régler, tous les deux..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/44/b/1 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/45/b/1 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dishy clutches at his door, his breath labored. You can see that he's taken quite a bit of damage, but more than that... he seems cowed."
msgstr "Dishy s'agrippe à sa porte, la respiration laborieuse. Il a visiblement pris cher, mais plus encore... il semble intimidé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/44/b/9 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/45/b/9 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/48
msgctxt "Dishy"
msgid "you... you... you..."
msgstr "vous... vous... vous..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
