msgstr "D'une manière... naturelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/c-0/31/c-1/26/0/s/0 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/c-0/15/c-1/26/0/s/0
