msgstr "J'ai hâte, Dishy. Allons te nettoyer."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/c-1/23 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/c-1/7
