msgstr "Rends-toi, Dishy ! Regarde le bazar que tu as fait !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/c-1/34/c-0/7 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/c-1/18/c-0/7
