msgstr "Je... n'ai pas le choix...."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/c-2/7/b/9 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end/0/c-2/8/b/9 dishy_dishwasher/dishy_battle_end_sinclaire_skip/0/c-2/15
